# The mihomo core is a 62 MB Go shared library and 94% of the built HAP, so it
# is built rather than committed. See core/README.md and core/build-core.sh.
# liblog.so is kept: it is a 12 KB stub and the link step needs it.
/entry/src/main/cpp/prebuilt/arm64-v8a/libclash.so
/entry/src/main/cpp/prebuilt/arm64-v8a/libclash.h

# A dev-only probe library that is not referenced by CMakeLists.txt.
